+---
+
+## Approach
+
+**Pattern reference**: `src/tally/storage.py` `load` — already uses `csv.reader(handle)` with `newline=""`; imitate it on the write side with `csv.writer`.
+
+**Vital slice**: Use `csv.writer` (default `lineterminator`, set to `"\n"`) in `append` and `save_all`. Open files with `newline=""`.
+**Cut list**: Migration or repair of existing bad lines — not built.
+
+Write the failing tests first (tdd), then fix. Keep `_ensure_file` / `HEADER` as they are.
+
