+
+## Edge Case Checklist
+
+- [ ] Comma in note
+- [ ] Double quote in note
+- [ ] Empty note still round-trips
+- [ ] `save_all` keeps atomic `os.replace` behaviour
+- [ ] No `\r\n` line endings appear on write (use `lineterminator="\n"`)
